One Off-Island Date Card is available.

1405
01:03:42,500 --> 01:03:43,733
I ran to grab that card.

1406
01:03:43,733 --> 01:03:44,666
I already promised her.

1407
01:03:44,700 --> 01:03:45,766
Pu Yanyan!

1408
01:03:47,033 --> 01:03:48,833
I was about to explode.

1409
01:03:48,833 --> 01:03:50,633
I felt like I didn't see
any reaction from you.

1410
01:03:50,633 --> 01:03:52,533
Yeah, maybe I overlooked it.

1411
01:03:52,533 --> 01:03:54,766
It felt like you didn't care
what I thought.

1412
01:03:54,800 --> 01:03:56,066
How could I not care what you think?

1413
01:03:56,066 --> 01:03:57,900
This is a big misunderstanding between us!
